   "en": "Second, we should jointly cultivate powerful momentum for the high-quality development of women’s cause. Modernization of the world should involve and benefit women. We should proactively address the imbalance and inadequacy of women’s development around the world, enable all women to share the benefits of economic globalization, and propel women’s all-round development. We need to seize the opportunity of the new wave of scientific and technological revolution and industrial transformation, and empower women’s high-quality development through innovation. We need to support women in playing an even bigger role in green development, and strive to help them shine in life and realize their dreams in this era of global modernization.",
